WEBVTT

00:00:22.820 --> 00:00:24.150
Lady Euphyllia.

00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:28.610
May I carry that one, as well?

00:00:29.960 --> 00:00:32.350
Yes, please do.

00:02:27.410 --> 00:02:36.010
The Magical Revolution

00:02:27.410 --> 00:02:36.010
The Magical Revolution

00:02:27.410 --> 00:02:36.010
of the Reincarnated Princess and the Genius Young Lady

00:02:55.790 --> 00:02:58.850
Oh, right... The villa...

00:03:04.530 --> 00:03:07.170
Lady Euphyllia, good morning.

00:03:07.170 --> 00:03:09.320
May I come in?

00:03:09.320 --> 00:03:10.620
Ilia?

00:03:14.670 --> 00:03:16.830
Thank you for coming every morning.

00:03:16.830 --> 00:03:18.960
You may come in.

00:03:18.960 --> 00:03:20.200
Pardon me.

00:03:25.180 --> 00:03:27.100
Did you sleep well last night?

00:03:31.550 --> 00:03:33.850
Yes, quite well.

00:03:38.930 --> 00:03:40.950
Have you grown accustomed to this place?

00:03:40.950 --> 00:03:44.540
Yes, and the move has proceeded smoothly.

00:03:45.210 --> 00:03:51.820
A lot has happened, but thanks to Miss Anis, 
I'm not seen as a mere curiosity.

00:03:51.820 --> 00:03:53.920
That is wonderful.

00:03:55.350 --> 00:03:59.330
I hate to say this immediately 
after things have settled down,

00:03:59.870 --> 00:04:03.750
but you've been summoned 
to the castle this afternoon.

00:04:03.750 --> 00:04:06.350
Yes, I know. For questioning, right?

00:04:06.960 --> 00:04:09.440
May I ask you to accompany me?

00:04:09.440 --> 00:04:11.570
There are things I'd like to bring back.

00:04:11.880 --> 00:04:13.760
Very well.

00:04:21.080 --> 00:04:23.030
Um, where is Miss Anis?

00:04:23.030 --> 00:04:25.900
She flew off on her broom at dawn.

00:04:25.900 --> 00:04:27.360
She made a grand show of it in secret.

00:04:27.360 --> 00:04:31.450
A grand show in secret? 
What a strange way to describe it.

00:04:31.450 --> 00:04:33.280
That is how things always are.

00:04:42.380 --> 00:04:44.250
What is that noise?!

00:04:45.070 --> 00:04:48.320
The alert system that Miss Anis invented.

00:04:48.320 --> 00:04:51.050
It sounds when someone 
suspicious enters the grounds

00:04:51.050 --> 00:04:54.850
and sends a notification to 
Miss Anis, but this time...

00:04:57.520 --> 00:04:59.180
Ow...

00:04:59.630 --> 00:05:01.400
I blew it again.

00:05:03.110 --> 00:05:05.470
Oh, good morning, Euphie!

00:05:05.470 --> 00:05:07.160
Good morning.

00:05:07.160 --> 00:05:08.940
Did you have breakfast already?

00:05:08.940 --> 00:05:10.910
Come help me experiment, then!

00:05:10.910 --> 00:05:13.120
Experiment?

00:05:13.120 --> 00:05:14.840
Yep! Remember what I said?

00:05:15.270 --> 00:05:18.050
I'm gonna make a special 
magic tool just for you!

00:05:26.470 --> 00:05:29.180
The first thing we're 
experimenting with is this!

00:05:29.180 --> 00:05:33.390
Ta-da-da-da! A Mana Blade!

00:05:34.260 --> 00:05:36.090
Here, try it out!

00:05:38.740 --> 00:05:41.500
U-Um, what am I supposed to do with...

00:05:41.500 --> 00:05:43.470
Just run some mana through it.

00:05:43.740 --> 00:05:45.460
O-Okay...

00:06:02.490 --> 00:06:04.920
This is very impressive.

00:06:04.920 --> 00:06:09.420
Uh-huh! It's a magic sword 
whose blade is activated by mana!

00:06:09.420 --> 00:06:11.610
The balance of spirit stones 
is really delicate, though,

00:06:11.610 --> 00:06:13.050
so forget about close-quarters combat.

00:06:13.050 --> 00:06:15.410
It's unfortunately a bit weak 
against physical impact,

00:06:14.350 --> 00:06:18.130
It's extremely portable and 
effective in magic combat.

00:06:15.410 --> 00:06:17.160
but it's super strong against magic!

00:06:17.160 --> 00:06:19.040
It's real handy for getting rid of magic!

00:06:18.130 --> 00:06:21.820
If it can also function as a wand, 
it'll be quite useful.

00:06:19.040 --> 00:06:21.820
Its strength and durability depend 
on how you set it up...

00:06:22.510 --> 00:06:25.930
That's it! Way to go, Euphie!

00:06:26.240 --> 00:06:30.790
Great looks, great smarts, 
and a great personality!

00:06:30.790 --> 00:06:32.340
R-Right...

00:06:35.030 --> 00:06:37.830
Okay, let's try this one next!

00:06:51.630 --> 00:06:55.600
Are you sure this is safe? 
It's shaking so much!

00:06:55.600 --> 00:06:56.600
I won't die, right?!

00:06:56.870 --> 00:07:00.270
You'll be just fine! I've got you!

00:07:00.270 --> 00:07:01.810
I won't let go of the back!

00:07:02.280 --> 00:07:04.800
You mean that? No matter what?

00:07:04.800 --> 00:07:06.260
You'd better promise!

00:07:06.260 --> 00:07:08.470
Don't let go under any circumstances!

00:07:08.470 --> 00:07:11.950
Yep, no matter what! I promise!

00:07:11.950 --> 00:07:13.500
Royals don't lie!

00:07:20.470 --> 00:07:21.830
I'm... flying?

00:07:22.370 --> 00:07:25.280
This is what it feels like to fly?

00:07:30.690 --> 00:07:33.190
Miss Anis, is this righ—

00:07:46.910 --> 00:07:48.440
Euphie!

00:07:51.680 --> 00:07:54.780
Are you okay?! I'm sorry! 
That was an accident!

00:07:54.780 --> 00:07:56.410
I-I mean it!

00:07:56.410 --> 00:07:58.970
I've already verified all 
the safety measures myself,

00:07:58.970 --> 00:08:00.370
so I thought you'd be fine!

00:08:01.780 --> 00:08:05.530
So, um... So, well...

00:08:05.530 --> 00:08:07.340
I-I'm sorry.

00:08:20.600 --> 00:08:22.160
Pardon my rudeness.

00:08:22.160 --> 00:08:24.720
No, it's totally fine!

00:08:24.720 --> 00:08:26.910
No, it really isn't.

00:08:26.910 --> 00:08:29.070
You are a princess.

00:08:29.070 --> 00:08:31.330
But I'm not next in line or anything.

00:08:31.330 --> 00:08:32.610
That doesn't matter.

00:08:32.610 --> 00:08:36.590
Besides, I am your assistant now.

00:08:36.590 --> 00:08:38.330
I must show you proper respect.

00:08:38.330 --> 00:08:42.010
You really don't need 
to treat this so formally.

00:08:42.010 --> 00:08:44.750
I just want you to enjoy playing right now.

00:08:45.220 --> 00:08:47.250
Playing?

00:08:47.250 --> 00:08:49.510
Well, until you get used to it, I mean!

00:08:49.510 --> 00:08:51.460
You can just treat this like play!

00:08:51.870 --> 00:08:54.430
And if you're gonna study, 
you should have fun doing it.

00:08:55.970 --> 00:08:58.470
Devices like this have a 
playful element to them, too.

00:08:58.470 --> 00:09:01.140
If you're too tense with them, 
they'll break in no time.

00:09:06.530 --> 00:09:09.310
Still, we can't have you 
playing around <i>too</i> much.

00:09:17.440 --> 00:09:19.840
Lady Euphyllia, it is time.

00:09:19.840 --> 00:09:21.590
Please get ready to go.

00:09:21.590 --> 00:09:22.280
Right.

00:09:22.810 --> 00:09:25.590
Well, Miss Anis, if you'll excuse me.

00:09:25.590 --> 00:09:26.890
You have to go somewhere?

00:09:26.890 --> 00:09:28.780
I've been summoned by His Majesty.

00:09:28.780 --> 00:09:32.000
Oh... Okay. See you later, then.

00:09:49.400 --> 00:09:52.720
Has Miss Anis always been like that?

00:09:52.720 --> 00:09:54.850
Most certainly not.

00:09:54.850 --> 00:09:57.060
Long ago, she was even more reckless.

00:09:57.060 --> 00:10:00.090
Her absurdity, idiocy, 
and insanity were on full display.

00:10:00.720 --> 00:10:03.250
You have quite a difficult job yourself.

00:10:03.250 --> 00:10:05.020
I'm all right.

00:10:05.020 --> 00:10:07.570
It's a maid's job to be at 
the mercy of her mistress.

00:10:08.190 --> 00:10:10.710
No... it's a perk, in fact.

00:10:10.960 --> 00:10:13.480
A perk? Really?

00:10:13.480 --> 00:10:15.430
Yes, a perk.

00:10:16.230 --> 00:10:19.130
I guess this is all still a bit beyond me.

00:10:19.130 --> 00:10:20.400
I'm sure.

00:10:20.400 --> 00:10:24.210
If you don't like it, it will be best 
for you both if you simply say so.

00:10:24.210 --> 00:10:26.730
Oh, no, it's not that I don't like it.

00:10:26.730 --> 00:10:27.920
How unusual.

00:10:27.920 --> 00:10:32.720
I had no idea there was anyone commendable 
enough to find that princess favorable.

00:10:32.720 --> 00:10:35.360
Well, I wouldn't say I find her favorable...

00:10:36.450 --> 00:10:39.820
The truth is that I simply don't understand.

00:10:40.780 --> 00:10:44.380
I do believe she's a good person, but...

00:10:48.460 --> 00:10:51.160
She's just... so far from me.

00:10:56.840 --> 00:11:01.300
For crying out loud... I don't even 
want to look at this testimony.

00:11:01.300 --> 00:11:04.160
I was present during the questioning,

00:11:04.160 --> 00:11:06.640
and he only said the same 
thing over and over.

00:11:06.640 --> 00:11:08.320
I see.

00:11:08.320 --> 00:11:12.990
I ordered Algard to remain in his chambers, 
but I suppose nothing has changed.

00:11:13.450 --> 00:11:16.110
He insists on choosing his own path,

00:11:16.110 --> 00:11:20.130
meaning he will not be bound to an 
engagement his father chose for him.

00:11:21.060 --> 00:11:23.930
For some random person on 
the street, that's fine,

00:11:23.930 --> 00:11:26.160
but we are a royal family.

00:11:26.160 --> 00:11:28.810
We have certain responsibilities!

00:11:28.810 --> 00:11:30.770
It's not just Prince Algard.

00:11:30.770 --> 00:11:33.010
The other boys said very similar things.

00:11:33.010 --> 00:11:37.110
You could try to put more pressure 
on them, but it would be difficult.

00:11:37.110 --> 00:11:39.400
They're all the sons of 
very powerful people.

00:11:39.400 --> 00:11:41.490
You can expect unwanted interference.

00:11:41.490 --> 00:11:48.450
Yes... and Count Chartreuse, the Secretary 
of Magic, is of particular concern.

00:11:48.450 --> 00:11:51.270
I'm sure he wants to protect his son, but...

00:11:51.270 --> 00:11:53.600
The count is a conservative leader.

00:11:53.600 --> 00:11:57.540
Since I am supported by the reformists, 
he sees me as an enemy,

00:11:57.540 --> 00:11:59.020
so he strongly resists me.

00:11:59.020 --> 00:12:01.540
Facing off with a conservative, eh?

00:12:01.540 --> 00:12:03.320
It all makes my stomach hurt.

00:12:05.520 --> 00:12:06.480
Enter.

00:12:15.660 --> 00:12:16.840
I see.

00:12:17.380 --> 00:12:22.040
So you had very little interaction 
with the daughter of Baron Cyan?

00:12:22.040 --> 00:12:23.080
Correct.

00:12:23.080 --> 00:12:26.770
I once offered her some advice, 
but no more than that.

00:12:27.240 --> 00:12:28.380
Hmm...

00:12:29.100 --> 00:12:34.140
I can't see any problem with your 
behavior as a betrothed noble lady.

00:12:34.590 --> 00:12:38.050
Any noble should understand that.

00:12:38.050 --> 00:12:41.100
It doesn't sit right with me to conclude 
that the prince and lady overreacted

00:12:41.100 --> 00:12:43.540
simply because they were maddened by love.

00:12:43.540 --> 00:12:47.190
Do you have any other ideas 
or realizations to share?

00:12:47.190 --> 00:12:49.900
Though I'm sure you aren't keen 
to recall that moment...

00:12:55.540 --> 00:12:59.210
Everyone seemed firmly convinced 
of their own righteousness.

00:12:59.470 --> 00:13:01.800
Even when he insulted me, 
I felt he was doing it

00:13:01.800 --> 00:13:05.260
not out of malice, but simply 
to follow his own conviction.

00:13:07.350 --> 00:13:10.330
Those who are intoxicated by 
their own sense of righteousness

00:13:10.330 --> 00:13:13.200
do tend to become blind to what 
happens around them...

00:13:15.030 --> 00:13:18.220
I'm sorry, but would you mind 
giving me some time?

00:13:18.660 --> 00:13:21.560
If I come across anything, I'll contact you.

00:13:21.560 --> 00:13:23.950
Of course. In that case...

00:13:36.650 --> 00:13:37.840
What is this?

00:13:37.840 --> 00:13:39.160
The key to the forbidden library.

00:13:39.860 --> 00:13:42.880
I was borrowing it for 
lessons on being a queen.

00:13:43.410 --> 00:13:45.110
I see.

00:13:45.110 --> 00:13:48.460
If you want, you're welcome 
to hold on to it.

00:13:50.670 --> 00:13:53.490
I no longer have the right.

00:13:53.490 --> 00:13:54.940
I return it to you.

00:13:54.940 --> 00:13:58.190
You were going through all that for us...

00:13:59.470 --> 00:14:00.450
I'm sorry.

00:14:00.450 --> 00:14:03.150
N-No, Your Majesty! Please don't say that!

00:14:03.590 --> 00:14:04.860
But...

00:14:05.920 --> 00:14:11.770
The prince's heart simply had no room 
for me in the first place.

00:14:12.490 --> 00:14:17.950
But I am not deeply wounded by that fact.

00:14:19.060 --> 00:14:21.980
It's as if I feel nothing...

00:14:21.980 --> 00:14:25.630
Like everything has completely dried up.

00:14:27.510 --> 00:14:30.220
You have more than fulfilled your role.

00:14:30.640 --> 00:14:32.990
You need not think about what comes next.

00:14:32.990 --> 00:14:36.020
There is nothing more you need to do.

00:14:40.700 --> 00:14:44.810
Then I'll say hello to everyone here 
who was kind to me, and return home.

00:14:48.980 --> 00:14:52.500
Don't you think you could have 
phrased that differently?

00:14:52.500 --> 00:14:54.460
You never say quite enough.

00:14:55.390 --> 00:14:56.670
Don't I?

00:14:57.010 --> 00:14:59.790
Being a father is difficult.

00:15:00.230 --> 00:15:01.870
You can say that again.

00:15:28.900 --> 00:15:30.510
Lady Euphyllia...

00:15:34.480 --> 00:15:36.320
Are you all well?

00:15:38.540 --> 00:15:40.380
You all did so much for me.

00:15:43.300 --> 00:15:44.840
Lady Euphyllia!

00:15:47.220 --> 00:15:50.810
Had I known you were coming, 
I would have come to collect you.

00:15:50.810 --> 00:15:53.100
I'm sorry to take up your time.

00:15:53.100 --> 00:15:55.280
I wanted to say hello to everyone.

00:15:55.280 --> 00:15:57.050
You honor us.

00:15:57.680 --> 00:16:00.280
Have you lost some weight?

00:16:00.280 --> 00:16:02.870
Yes, just a bit. I'm sorry.

00:16:02.870 --> 00:16:05.520
No, no. You have nothing to apologize for.

00:16:06.290 --> 00:16:08.030
Oh, that's right.

00:16:08.310 --> 00:16:11.490
My dress fittings will 
no longer be necessary.

00:16:12.990 --> 00:16:17.590
Your body shape never changed 
a bit, Lady Euphyllia.

00:16:17.590 --> 00:16:18.790
Really?

00:16:18.790 --> 00:16:20.150
Of course.

00:16:20.150 --> 00:16:21.620
That sounds wonderful.

00:16:23.080 --> 00:16:25.220
The princess eats and drinks too much,

00:16:25.220 --> 00:16:28.540
and she always runs amok in her dresses, 
so I have to mend them over and over.

00:16:28.540 --> 00:16:32.600
And she hates corsets and bustiers. 
She is truly a free spirit.

00:16:34.800 --> 00:16:36.660
I can picture that.

00:16:39.120 --> 00:16:43.100
Perhaps you are just as 
free now, Lady Euphyllia.

00:16:43.100 --> 00:16:45.790
You don't need to wear 
dresses or corsets anymore.

00:16:45.790 --> 00:16:49.650
There is nothing to tie you down any longer.

00:16:51.850 --> 00:16:53.320
You're right.

00:16:58.020 --> 00:17:01.010
Nothing... Nothing at all.

00:17:19.010 --> 00:17:20.720
Euphie!

00:17:20.720 --> 00:17:23.430
Miss Anis? What are you wearing?

00:17:23.430 --> 00:17:26.990
Oh, sorry! I only slept 
for about two hours...

00:17:26.990 --> 00:17:28.770
Actually, more like one hour...

00:17:28.770 --> 00:17:30.930
Yeah, I only slept for an hour.

00:17:30.930 --> 00:17:32.860
In fact, it's more like 
I didn't sleep at all!

00:17:35.080 --> 00:17:37.290
Sorry I kept you waiting!

00:17:41.100 --> 00:17:42.460
Is this...

00:17:42.460 --> 00:17:47.230
Yes! The blade is an alloy containing spirit 
stones, making it a conductor for mana!

00:17:47.870 --> 00:17:51.020
But we should probably test out 
its mana conductivity first.

00:17:51.020 --> 00:17:53.840
If it works, we can add different 
attributes to the blade!

00:17:53.840 --> 00:17:57.050
Then it'll be a luxury item 
that'll help you with using magic!

00:17:58.690 --> 00:17:59.750
In other words...

00:17:59.750 --> 00:18:02.980
I finished your special magic tool!

00:18:03.490 --> 00:18:06.430
My own... special magic tool?

00:18:06.430 --> 00:18:08.340
Yeah! Now let's—

00:18:08.340 --> 00:18:11.890
Princess, please change your clothes first.

00:18:17.860 --> 00:18:20.980
Okay! Go on and try it out!

00:18:20.980 --> 00:18:24.290
You can just use that tree as a target.

00:18:24.290 --> 00:18:26.740
What? A-Are you sure?

00:18:26.740 --> 00:18:27.620
Uh-huh!

00:18:34.290 --> 00:18:38.760
<i>Amazing... It's as though 
it's already a part of me.</i>

00:18:41.240 --> 00:18:42.740
Fireball!

00:18:51.690 --> 00:18:53.860
Wow, that was awesome!

00:18:53.860 --> 00:18:55.870
Well? Well? What do you think?

00:18:57.150 --> 00:18:59.330
It's an incredible item.

00:18:59.740 --> 00:19:01.620
I'm so glad to hear it!

00:19:01.620 --> 00:19:04.220
Okay, now test it out as a magic sword, too!

00:19:07.110 --> 00:19:08.910
Blade, assume form...

00:19:10.500 --> 00:19:12.220
Water Blade!

00:19:13.220 --> 00:19:16.570
Wow! It really is a sword!

00:19:17.390 --> 00:19:20.890
This is... How shall I put it? 
Very interesting.

00:19:31.370 --> 00:19:32.760
It's still true.

00:19:35.490 --> 00:19:38.700
Euphie's magic is so beautiful.

00:19:45.970 --> 00:19:48.700
Thank you, Miss Anis.

00:19:48.700 --> 00:19:49.880
Don't mention it.

00:19:49.880 --> 00:19:54.180
It was really fun thinking about 
what would suit you best.

00:19:54.840 --> 00:19:57.960
Does it... really suit me?

00:19:58.970 --> 00:20:00.100
Sure it does.

00:20:02.310 --> 00:20:06.560
It all started with the concept 
of something made just for you.

00:20:07.270 --> 00:20:08.820
It has to suit you.

00:20:11.810 --> 00:20:15.060
I thought of a name for it, too.

00:20:15.060 --> 00:20:17.300
A name?

00:20:17.940 --> 00:20:18.730
Yeah.

00:20:20.090 --> 00:20:21.700
Arc-en-Ciel.

00:20:23.950 --> 00:20:26.220
Arc... en Ciel?

00:20:27.870 --> 00:20:29.200
It means "rainbow."

00:20:30.260 --> 00:20:32.680
It has lots of different magic attributes,

00:20:32.680 --> 00:20:34.610
and lots of colors.

00:20:34.610 --> 00:20:36.140
It's perfect for you.

00:20:36.840 --> 00:20:39.760
Rainbow colors... are perfect for me?

00:20:45.170 --> 00:20:48.730
Thank you. It's a lovely name.

00:20:53.420 --> 00:20:55.820
Really? I'm glad.

00:21:05.110 --> 00:21:06.670
U-Um...

00:21:07.420 --> 00:21:10.650
It really is a perfect match.

00:21:12.160 --> 00:21:14.150
I've always thought...

00:21:14.750 --> 00:21:18.800
that you were as pretty as a rainbow.

00:21:19.800 --> 00:21:23.160
You really are... so pretty, it's unfair...

00:21:27.430 --> 00:21:29.210
Miss Anis?

00:21:36.770 --> 00:21:38.600
What am I going to do with you?

00:21:40.570 --> 00:21:45.410
No one has ever rested 
their head on my lap before.

00:21:51.560 --> 00:21:55.780
I envy you, Miss Anis.

00:21:57.440 --> 00:22:03.370
If I could be even the least 
little bit like you...

00:22:02.460 --> 00:22:04.970
Episode Three

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:39.970
Episode Four 
